[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 313.11, "timestamp": "00:05:13", "text": "老兄，好久沒開槍了，我又要開始「砰砰」地射擊了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 315.99, "timestamp": "00:05:15", "text": "等不及了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 318.87, "timestamp": "00:05:18", "text": "呃，稍等一下。 [音樂] 我的電腦沒有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 333.51, "timestamp": "00:05:33", "text": "我的天啊。我得拿到連結。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 335.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:05:35", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 338.07, "timestamp": "00:05:38", "text": "M："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 351.749, "timestamp": "00:05:51", "text": "那麼，大家早上過得怎麼樣呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 356.31, "timestamp": "00:05:56", "text": "你在威尼斯過得怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 358.31, "timestamp": "00:05:58", "text": "今天是威尼斯日。你"}]